<title>POLAND: Debica to cut jobs by five pct by April.</title>
<headline>Debica to cut jobs by five pct by April.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish tyre maker TC Debica SA will reduce its workforce by 239 workers, or five percent, by the end of March, its spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Andrzej Czarnecki told PAP news agency the job cuts were caused by organisational changes within Debica and that trade unions had been consulted.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
